{
 "name": "cable_bunny",
 "title": "Cable Bunny - USB-C cable tester: VBUS, GND, CC, D+, D-, SBU, CR2032",
 "revision": "A",
 "brief": "A bunny-shaped USB-C cable tester with no MCU. Both ends of a cable plug into the two USB-C receptacles that are its feet; pressing its nose connects a CR2032 through a B5819W to every line of the first receptacle through 150 ohm, and every line that reaches the second receptacle lights its own LED through 220 ohm in the bunny's ears (VBUS, GND, CC; D+, D-, SBU). A heart LED shows the cell is good. 2 layers, single-sided SMT, white mask, black silk, ENIG.",
